# Note: examples/nextjs-tool-call/{components,tools,instructions}/hitl-ui/ are
# regenerated by `hitl-ui add --force` on every prebuild but are intentionally
# committed — Tailwind v4 respects .gitignore for content auto-detection, so
# excluding them would break the example's styling.
